  << /ActualText (EasyAP is an EdTech software project I\031m currently developing\056 For this website design\054 I drew inspiration from the modern trend of startup web designs that feature bold\054 vibrant colors\056 I selected a purple and pink color scheme to appeal to my target audience\024teenagers\024making sure the design is eye\055catching and engaging\056 All graphics were created by me using Figma\056\n\n\n\n\n\n\n)
