2648 0 obj
  << /ActualText (For me\054 web development and design is a form of art that allows me to express my creativity and bring ideas to life\056 This portfolio showcases a collection of websites I\031ve created either for work \050through internships\051\054 personal software projects\054 or designs for local businesses through my web\055development agency\056 \n\nThe lifecycle is simple\072 each website starts as a mockup in Figma\054 where I\031ll bring the design to life\056 After that\054 I translate the design to code using ReactJS and TailwindCSS\056\n\nOn the following pages\054 you\031ll find information regarding my websites\054 including their links\054 color palettes\054 design choices\054 and of course\054 the actual design\056\n\nIf the design appears blurry or unclear\054 each website is also live online and fully responsive on mobile\054 tablet\054 and desktop devices\056 Links are provided for convenient access\056\n\nFeel free to reach out at pranavkonjeti\100gmail\056com\056 Always happy to chat about anything and everything \072\051)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 2649 0 R
     /Pg 2442 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

